    "text": "The correct order for acid strength of compounds <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>CH</mi><mo>&#8801;</mo><mi>CH</mi><mo>,</mo><mtext>&#8201;</mtext><msub><mi>CH</mi><mn>3</mn></msub><mo>-</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi><mo>&#8801;</mo><mi>CH</mi></math> and <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>CH</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>CH</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></math> is as follows:"
